  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Sinful Spoils of the Winter Raven's Forest",
      "effect": "You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by placing 1 Level 1 FIRE Monster Card from your face-up field or GY on the bottom of the Deck. You can only Special Summon \"Sinful Spoils of the Winter Raven's Forest\" once per turn this way. When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can return this card from the field to the hand, then target 1 face-up monster on the field or in either GY; place it face-up in its owner's Spell & Trap Zone as a Continuous Spell. You can only use this effect of \"Sinful Spoils of the Winter Raven's Forest\" once per turn."
    },
